d College''s eLumen reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ELET B3 is the only course required outright within ''Lower Division Core Courses'' (stated 23-27.5); the remaining lower-division units come from the nested choose-units blocks (Electric Circuits, AutoCAD, Technology Systems, Programming, Chemistry, Math), recorded as separate blocks.","where":"Bakersfield College''s eLumen reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Each nested requirement reads ''Complete the following number of credits: N-M''; minimum recorded as the low end N, stated as the printed range.","where":"Bakersfield College''s eLumen reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Catalog prints ELET B55A as ''Electric Motors - Controls'' (closed list: ''Electric Motors and Controls'').","where":"Bakersfield College''s eLumen reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"COMP B10, COMP B11, INDA B132 and INDA B150 are not on the closed list and are flagged as catalog additions.","where":"Bakersfield College''s eLumen reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Career ''technologists'' taken from the program description (''equips students with the skill set those technologists require'').","where":"Bakersfield College''s eLumen reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Source URL references ''spring-2024'' though the catalog is labeled 2026-2027; verify the program version.","where":"Bakersfield College''s eLumen reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"college-page-read run 37810652946","host":"programmap.bakersfieldcollege.edu","status":"refused","text":"programmap.bakersfieldcollege.edu answered 403 Forbidden to the CPL Initiative''s reader on 2026-10-08 (one load), as every Program Mapper host read so far has: the refusal is the mapper service''s. The college''s own Program Pathways Mapper page answers and says each