m Mapper host read so far has: the refusal is the mapper service''s. The college''s own Program Pathways Mapper page answers and says each program shows a semester-by-semester path. The reader keeps its name and never retries a refusal another way. It looks for the sequence on the college''s own pages and in its catalog (Sam, open-asks sheet 29 card 3, 2026-10-04).","url":"https://www.bakersfieldcollege.edu/academics/program-mapper.html"},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Bakersfield College' and r.control_number = '40359' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
