s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"KIN 132 matches the closed-list entry ''KIN132'' (missing space, units not stored); treated as the same course.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No units printed beside alternatives HED 110, DANC 104, DANC 103, WGS 108.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The degree requires 60 units including ''the General Education requirements''; no GE pattern is named, so ge_pattern is null.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Recommended Courses HED 100, PSYC C1000, SOCI C1000 are recommended only and not placed in blocks.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Program Student Learning Outcomes are printed once on this A.A. page and recorded as printed (including ''academic discipline'').","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Cerritos College''s site (census run census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Cerritos College' and r.control_number = '02219' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
