ection 1'' heading. List A is recorded as its own choose-one block.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The 4-4.5 range printed beside STAT C1000 and MATH 114 appears to cover each course''s ''or'' group. Alternatives with no printed units are left null.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Course titles in the catalog differ from closed-list titles for some codes (e.g., EDEL 210, CDEV C1000), but the codes match.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"General education is required for the degree but no specific GE pattern is named, so ge_pattern is null.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The five Program Student Learning Outcomes are copied as printed, including ''working with student with disabilities''. A leading zero-width character before the fifth outcome was dropped.","where":"Cerritos College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Cerritos College''s site (census run census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Cerritos College' and r.control_number = '44983' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
