 Courses'' (BIOL 22, BIOL 23, BIOL 23L, ENGL C1000, MATH 401, PSYCH 25 and the GE area placeholders).","where":"Chaffey College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No GE pattern is named explicitly; the Area 2/3/6 references suggest a GE pattern but it is not identified, so ge_pattern is null.","where":"Chaffey College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Required Core courses are listed in the catalog order except NURADN 39 was printed between NURADN 35 and NURADN 47; correct catalog order is NURADN 6, 15, 28, 29, 35, 39, 47, 49.","where":"Chaffey College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No careers are named in the text.","where":"Chaffey College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261011T162433Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Chaffey College''s site (census run census-20261011T162433Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Chaffey College' and r.control_number = '04788' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
