nity College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Arts and Humanities prints a group total of 6 units with ''Select at least one course from each area''. The total was not attached to the Arts or Humanities sub-blocks.","where":"Coastline Community College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"History and Political Science prints a group total of 9 units covering the two required courses plus one selected course. The total was not attached to either sub-block.","where":"Coastline Community College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ENGL C1001 appears both in Language Studies (or PHIL C115) and as a Humanities option. Whether one course can count twice is not stated.","where":"Coastline Community College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"MATH C104 and MATH C106 appear both in Mathematics and in Suggested Electives, the latter marked ''*If not used as Mathematics requirement above''.","where":"Coastline Community College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Suggested Electives note reads ''Select additional courses to complete at least 60 units''. These do not count toward the 47.5-48.5 major total.","where":"Coastline Community College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Printed titles differ from the state file for several courses: EDUC C200 is printed as ''Introduction to Elementary Classroom Teaching'' (state: The Teaching Profession), HIST C170 as ''to 1877'' (state: To 1876), ENGL C140 as ''Introduction to Literature'' (state: Appreciation of Literature), and GEOL C105L as ''Geology Lab''.","where":"Coastline Community College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The program learning outcomes are printed in the Overview for this A.A. degree.","where":"Coastline Community College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261011T162427Z-s3of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Coastline Community College''s site (census run census-20261011T162427Z-s3of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Coastline Community College' and r.control_number = '18002' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
