 1A tab is labeled ''Area 1 (1A/1B): English Composition, Oral Communication and'' (truncated) but lists English composition courses; recorded as Area 1A: English Composition.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Stated minimums (''Minimum 3 units'', ''3 units minimum'') recorded as stated min 3 with max null.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Honors twins printed on separate rows (e.g., ENGL C1000 / ENGL C1000H, MATH C2210 / C2210H, STAT C1000 / C1000H) were recorded as one entry with the honors course as alternative; enhanced versions (ENGL C1000E, STAT C1000E) kept as separate catalog-addition entries.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Catalog prints ARTH C1100/C1100H, ARTH C1200/C1200H and CDEV C1000 with a space; matched to closed-list ARTHC1100, ARTHC1200, CDEVC1000.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"LING 1H, LING 3H, PHIL 1H, PHIL 10H, SPAN 1H, SPAN 2H appear as honors alternatives but are not in the closed list (catalog additions).","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Area 4 course list is cut off mid-entry at ''POLSC 10 Introduction''; remaining Area 4 courses and the course lists for Areas 5 (Natural Sciences), 6 (Ethnic Studies), 7 (Lifelong Understanding and Self Development) and 8 (American Institutions and Ideals) are not in the text, so those blocks were not recorded.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"PHIL 2 and PHIL 10/10H appear in both Area 3 and Area 4; the catalog states a course may satisfy only one area. Cross-listed courses (ECON 5 = GEOG 5, HUMAN 1/1H = SOCSC 1/1H, HUMAN 7 = SOCSC 7, PH 10 = PSYCH 10) may be used in only one subject area.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No program learning outcomes or careers are printed for this award; ''Careers'' appears only in the site footer menu.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Read in 2 parts, because one reply could not hold the whole record.","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Reviewer: part 2 names blocks part 1 does not: ''Area 1 (1A/1B): English Composition, Oral Communication and Critical Thinking'' (kept beside ''Area 1A: English Composition'')","where":"Long Beach City College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Long Beach City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152831Z-s3of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Long Beach City College' and r.control_number = '37213' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
