 reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The outcomes are printed once for the program, and this award shares them. ''cardiorespitory'' is copied as printed.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Movement Based Courses: the catalog says ''Select a maximum of one course from any three of the following areas (3 units)''. The student takes one course from each of three different areas. The areas are: Combative (KIN-A40, KIN-A41); Dance (DAN-D21, DAN-D31); Fitness (KIN-A46, KIN-A47, KIN-A75A, KIN-A75B, KIN-A81A, KIN-A81B, KIN-A86, KIN-A87); Team Sports (KIN-A62, KIN-A64A, KIN-A64B). This was recorded as one choose-3 block; the per-area limit is not captured by the rule.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Several movement courses are marked ''( Historical )'' in the catalog: DAN-D31, KIN-A75A, KIN-A86, KIN-A64A and KIN-A64B.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"KIN-A86 (Step Aerobics) and KIN-A87 (Step Aerobics, Intermediate) are not in the closed list and are marked as catalog additions.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"List A: the student selects two courses. Each ''Only one of the following may be used'' group was recorded as a single entry with alternatives: STAT-C1000/STAT-C1000H/PSYC-48/SOC-48; CHE-1A/CHE-1AH; PSYC-C1000/PSYC-C1000H/SOC-1.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The closed list stores ''PSYC48'' with no space and no units. It was treated as matching the catalog''s PSYC-48 (4 units).","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261