alley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"List A - Electives groups its courses under Area 1-6 subheadings (Administration of Justice/Criminal Justice/Criminology, Business, Economics, Political Science, Diversity, College Success); the student selects one course from any area. Recorded as one choose-one block.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"BUS-18A is marked ''( Historical )'' in the catalog in both places it appears.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Closed-list codes ENGLC1003/ENGLC1003H, HISTC1001H/HISTC1002H, ECONC2001H/ECONC2002H and PSYC48 are written without spaces; matched to catalog codes ENGL-C1003/H, HIST-C1001H/C1002H, ECON-C2001H/C2002H and PSYC-48.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"HIST-C1001, HIST-C1002, ECON-C2001 and ECON-C2002 are not in the closed list (which carries HIS 6, HIS 7, ECO 8, ECO 7), so they are marked catalog additions.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page prints one Program Learning Outcomes list for this program; the A.A.-T shares it and it is recorded.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Moreno Valley College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Moreno Valley College' and r.control_number = '45447' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
