 Study Abroad Program) lists no courses: ''Any course taken while participating in an RCCD Study Abroad Program.'' Recorded as an empty block with no minimum.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Honors versions are recorded as alternatives of their base course (ARTH-C1100H, ARTH-C1200H, MUS-19H, ANT-2H, GEG-1H, POLS-2H, POLS-4H, ARA-11H, SPA-2H, HUM-4H, HUM-5H, HUM-10H, HIST-2H).","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog prints history courses as HIST-16, HIST-17, HIST-18, HIST-19, HIST-2, HIST-35, HIST-42; the closed list stores these as HIS. They are flagged as catalog additions under the strict code rule but are likely the same courses under a renamed subject.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"MUS-22, THE-3, THE-9 and THE-34 are marked ''( Historical )'' in the catalog but are still listed in Group 1.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Cross-listed pairs appear as separate entries as printed: ECON-6/POLS-6, ENGL-8/HUM-8, ETS-13/PHI-14.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"THE-35 is printed as ''Classical Acting with Emphasis in Shakespearean Verse''; the closed-list title differs slightly.","where":"Moreno Valley College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Moreno Valley College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Moreno Valley College' and r.control_number = '45914'