 College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Blocks are read from the ''Required Courses'' list, which carries the stated Total Units 63-66. The ''Prerequisite Courses'' (ANAT sequence, MICR 1/22, ENGL C1000/C1000H/AMLA 1A) and ''ADN General Education Requirements'' (COMM, PSYC C1000, PSYC 14/CHLD 10) lists on the page repeat courses that also appear in Required Courses and are not recorded separately.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog prints ''Select one of the following sequences: 8-10'' with paired ''or'' rows (ANAT 10A or ANAT 35; ANAT 10B or ANAT 36); recorded as two sequence blocks in one option_group. The 8-10 total is printed once for the whole choice and is recorded as stated on both sequence blocks; no units are printed beside the individual ANAT courses.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The closed list stores ''MICR1'' (no space, units not stored); the catalog prints ''MICR 1 Medical Microbiology 4-5''. Treated as the same course, so catalog_addition is false; reviewer should confirm.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"NURS 212 Preceptorship in Nursing (2 units) is printed in the catalog but not in the closed list, which instead has NURS 11 Preceptorship in Nursing (2 units); likely a renumbering. NURS 212 marked as catalog addition.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Units for ''or'' alternatives are not printed beside them in the catalog and are left null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"COMM, PSYC and CHLD/PSYC 14 courses are labeled ''ADN General Education Requirements'' elsewhere on the page but are included in the Required Courses list and its 63-66 total, so they are recorded in the block.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Footnotes in the ADN GE list: PSYC 14 (and alternatives) must be completed before NURS 115; PSYC C1000 must be completed before NURS 207.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page lists additional general education areas and graduation requirements (Mathematics, Arts and Humanities, History/Political Science, Ethnic Studies, Physical Well-Being, Reading Competency) but names no specific GE pattern; ge_pattern left null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Program Learning Outcome comes from the program''s outcomes tab; it is printed once for the program, and this award (the only award on the page) shares it. A link ''Review Student Learning Outcomes (SLOs) for this program'' is printed but no further outcomes appear in the text.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Antonio College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Mt. San Antonio College' and r.control_number = '03054' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
