owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints HIST C1002H for this program, and the state''s Program Course File carries it there: the program points at HIST C1002H CCC000385142, Approved in COCI.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints ARTH C1100 for this program; the state''s Program Course File does not list it.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Check not met","owner":"procedure","text":"The blocks add to 15-16 units; the catalog prints 18 units.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog prints no units beside individual courses; only block totals are printed (Required Core 3; ''Choose one course from each of the five categories (List A through List E)'' 15; Total Units 18). The 15 units apply to Lists A-E together, so each list block''s stated is left null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Each of Lists A-E is recorded as a choose-1-course block; the subheadings within each list (Classical Humanities, Western Humanities, Global Humanities, Modern American Humanities, etc.) are groupings only and do not appear to impose separate requirements.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"HIST 3/3H and HIST 4/4H appear under both ''Classical and Western'' and ''Global'' in List B; recorded once. PHIL 20A/20AH appears under both Classical and Western Humanities, and PHIL 20B/20BH under both Western and ''Modern America Humanities'' in List E; recorded once.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Catalog uses prefix ARTH where the closed list uses AHIS for most art history courses (ARTH 3, 6, 8, 9, 11, 12, 12H, 13, 14, 15); these are marked catalog_addition true by code, but likely correspond to the AHIS courses of the same number. ARTH 10, ARTH 11H, ARTH 3H, ARTH 6H, ARTH C1100H and ARTH C1200H match closed-list entries apart from spacing. ARTH C1100 and ARTH C1200 (non-honors) are not in the closed list.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"HIST C1001/C1001H and HIST C1002/C1002H are not in the closed list; they appear to replace HIST 7/7H and HIST 8/8H (Cal-GETC common course numbering).","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"DN-T 20 matched to closed-list DN T 20; HIST 31 matched to HIST31.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"General Education is required but no specific GE pattern is named, so ge_pattern is null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The outcomes are printed on the program''s Outcomes tab as Program Learning Outcomes for this program; recorded as this award''s outcomes. The page also links to separate SLOs not included in the text.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Antonio College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Mt. San Antonio College' and r.control_number = '18236' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
