m record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Check not met","owner":"procedure","text":"The blocks add to 0 units; the catalog prints 18-22 units.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The overall rule is ''Choose a minimum of 18 units from the following with at least one GE lab from each group'' (printed 18-22) spanning all six groups; it is not tied to a single group block, so each group block has stated null and the 18-22 range is recorded as total_units. Groups are recorded as choose_courses with minimum 0 because the group-level minimum depends on cross-group rules.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Lab constraints: at least one course from Group 1B or 1C, and at least one course from Group 2B or 2C. Groups 1A and 2A say ''May take one or more courses''.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Group 2B also prints ''Choose at least one from the following:'', which conflicts with its own heading note allowing the lab requirement to be met from 2B or 2C; read here as the either-2B-or-2C rule. Reviewer should check.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog''s units column is empty for every course, so all course units are null.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"MICR 1 is printed as ''Medical Microbiology'' while the closed list titles it ''Principles of Microbiology''.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No GE pattern is named; the text says only ''completion of General Education coursework''.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The outcomes tab prints the first outcome (''Analyze and model chemical, physical, or biological systems...'') twice; both printed entries are copied as shown. Likely a duplication on the page.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Antonio College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Mt. San Antonio College' and r.control_number = '18242' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
