 missing_explained; a reviewer should confirm they are the same courses renumbered/re-prefixed. Closed-list codes printed without a space (ARTH10, ARTH11H, ARTH16, ARTH16H, ARTH3H, ARTH6H, ARTHC1100H, ARTHC1200H, ARTD20) were treated as matching the catalog''s spaced codes.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ARTH C1100 and ARTH C1200 (non-honors) do not appear in the closed list in any form and are recorded as catalog additions.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Core Courses is read as three required entries: one of ARTH C1100/C1100H/C1200/C1200H; one of ARTH 9/11/11H/12/12H/13/16/16H; and ARTD 15A.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"List C: ''Choose one course not already used from List A or List B''; its list repeats all List A and List B courses. Courses also appear across Core and List A/C (e.g., ARTH 9, 11, 12, 13, 16); a course may not be used twice.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Outcomes come from the page''s Outcomes tab under ''Program Learning Outcomes'' for this program. The second outcome references ''Area C: Arts'', which reads like a GE-area outcome; a reviewer may wish to check it. The page also links to separate SLOs not included in the text.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Degree requires 60 units including Cal-GETC (34 units printed); courses may double-count for the major and Cal-GETC.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Anto