ed. The catalog''s own total of 18 matches the printed 1-unit values.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The outcomes tab has the heading ''Program Learning Objectives'', but it lists only possible careers (''students will be prepared for careers such as:'' followed by job settings for a yoga instructor). These are not learning outcomes, so program.outcomes is left empty. A reviewer may want to confirm this.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page title calls the award ''Certificate''. The overview states that a Certificate of Achievement is granted on completing all mandatory courses with a grade of C or higher.","where":"Mt. San Antonio College''s CourseLeaf reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Mt. San Antonio College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Mt. San Antonio College' and r.control_number = '46187' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
