,{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Required courses block states 16.00 units but lists only APP-450 at 4.00 units. APP-450 may be taken repeatedly, perhaps 4 times, to reach 16 units; a reviewer should check this.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Elective Courses block states 14.00-15.00 units. However, the listed items (each ''Choose one course'' pair counted once, plus MAN-35, MAN-36, MAN-56 and MAN-57) sum to 28 units. I read the block as choosing courses totaling at least 14 units from the list, and modeled each ''Choose one course'' OR pair as one entry with an alternative. The catalog does not say clearly how the 14-15 units are to be selected, so a reviewer should check this reading.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The catalog total is 30.00-31.00 units, which matches 16 required units plus 14-15 elective units.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The degree requires general education, but the text names no specific GE pattern, so ge_pattern is null.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Codes are written as printed with hyphens (e.g., ENE-30), while the closed list uses spaces (ENE 30). DFT, ELE and APP codes, ENE-42 and MAN-35 are not in the closed list and are marked as catalog additions.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Norco College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Norco College' and r.control_number = '40064' on conflict