ollege''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Electives: ''Select 6 units from below from two different areas. The courses must not have been used previously.'' Areas 1-8 (Administration of Justice/Criminal Justice/Criminology; Business; Economics; Political Science; Public Policy; Diversity; College Success; Internship/Fieldwork) are flattened into one choose_units block; the two-different-areas constraint is not captured structurally.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Several courses (ADJ-1/1H, ADJ-2, ADJ-3/3H, BUS-18A) appear both in a required choice and in the electives; per the catalog they may not be used twice.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"HIST-C1001, HIST-C1002, ECON-C2001 and ECON-C2002 are not in the closed list (closed list carries HIS 6/7 and ECO 7/8, likely the pre-common-numbering codes), so they are flagged catalog_addition; their honors versions match closed-list codes HISTC1001H, HISTC1002H, ECONC2001H, ECONC2002H.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"PSYC-48 and SOC-48 share the title ''Statistics for the Behavioral Sciences'' and are likely cross-listed; recorded as separate options.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"BUS-18A is marked ''( Historical )'' in the catalog.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Honors twins are recorded as alternatives of the base course.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Program learning outcomes are printed once for the program and recorded for this degree.","where":"Norco College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Norco College''s site (census run census-20261004T152834Z-s1of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Norco College' and r.control_number = '44961' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
