ind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints ADM-83, ADM-69A, ADM-69B for this program; the state''s Program Course File does not list them.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Check not met","owner":"procedure","text":"The blocks add to 31-34 units; the catalog prints 34 units.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page prints one combined section for the A.S. Degree and Certificate of Achievement (heading repeated three times with slightly different codes: AS653/AS653C/CE653 and AS653/AS653B/AS653C/CE653); the requirements, total (34 units) and program learning outcomes are shared by both awards and recorded here for the A.S. Degree.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Electives (Units: 6.00): ''Choose six units from one emphasis.'' Each emphasis is recorded in option_group ''Emphasis''. The Graphic Design Emphasis consists of two blocks taken together (ADM-62 required plus one course from the ''Select one of the following'' list, 3 units); a reviewer should treat those two blocks as one option, not two separate options.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ADM-77B appears in both the Packaging Design Emphasis and the Graphic Design Emphasis choice list.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Catalog titles differ from the closed list for some courses (e.g., ADM-63A printed as ''Design For Print Publication'' vs. ''Adobe InDesign, Beginning''; ADM-77A ''Adobe Illustrator for Graphic Art''; ADM-71B ''Adobe Photoshop, Advanced''; ADM-77B ''Adobe Illustrator, Advanced''); codes match.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Courses not in the closed list recorded as catalog additions: ADM-83, ADM-62, ADM-63B, ADM-69A, ADM-69B.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No general education pattern is named; the text refers only to ''general education and other graduation requirements as described in the college catalog.''","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Outcome 8 is copied as printed, including the run-together ''anability''.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Riverside City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Riverside City College' and r.control_number = '31767' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
