 CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"NRN-12A (Nursing Learning Laboratory, 0.50) is printed in the catalog but is not in the closed list, so it is marked as a catalog addition.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"NRN-11A, NRN-21A and NRN-22A are marked ''( Historical )'' in the catalog, yet they remain listed as required. A reviewer should check whether they are still required for 2026-2027.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The program learning outcomes are printed once, for the program as a whole. The A.S. degree shares them, so they are recorded here.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Riverside City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Riverside City College' and r.control_number = '38259' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
