y to 1877) instead.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The state''s Program Course File lists HIS 7; the reader found it not in the text; catalog prints HIST-C1002 (United States History since 1865) instead.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The state''s Program Course File lists ECO 7; the reader found it not in the text; catalog prints ECON-C2002 (Principles of Macroeconomics) instead.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The state''s Program Course File lists ECO 8; the reader found it not in the text; catalog prints ECON-C2001 (Principles of Microeconomics) instead.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"coci":[{"code":"HIST-C1001","current_ccn":null,"program_ccn":"CCC000252185","status":"Active"}],"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints HIST-C1001 for this program, and the state''s Program Course File carries it there: the program points at HIST-C1001 CCC000252185, Active in COCI.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"coci":[{"code":"HIST-C1002","current_ccn":null,"program_ccn":"CCC000335450","status":"Active"}],"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints HIST-C1002 for this program, and the state''s Program Course File carries it there: the program points at HIST-C1002 CCC000335450, Active in COCI.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"coci":[{"code":"ECON-C2001","current_ccn":null,"program_ccn":"CCC000292920","status":"Active"}],"kind":"Catalog and state file diff