re":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Electives - List A: ''Select two courses from two of the areas listed below. (Note: course must not have been used above)''. The two courses must come from two different areas; recorded as one choose 2 courses block. Areas: 1 Administration of Justice/Criminal Justice/Criminology (ADJ-1/1H, ADJ-2, ADJ-3/3H, ADJ-4, ADJ-5, ADJ-8, ADJ-20, SOC-20); 2 Business (BUS-18A); 3 Economics (ECON-C2001/H, ECON-C2002/H); 4 Political Science (POLS-2/2H, POLS-4/4H, POLS-11); 5 Public Policy (ETS-1, SOC-2, ADJ-9/9H, POLS-5); 6 Diversity (ANT-2/2H, COMM-12, GEG-2, SOC-10/10H, SOC-25); 7 College Success (GUI-48); 8 Internship/Fieldwork (ADJ-200, 3-4 units).","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"PSYC-48 and SOC-48 share the title ''Statistics for the Behavioral Sciences'' and are recorded as one choice (cross-listed); SOC-48 is not on the closed list. PSYC-48 matched to closed-list ''PSYC48'', which stores no units.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"HIST-C1001, HIST-C1002, ECON-C2001, ECON-C2002 are printed in the catalog but the closed list has only their honors versions plus the older HIS 6/HIS 7/ECO 7/ECO 8 codes; reviewer should confirm equivalence.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"COMM-6 is titled ''Small Group Communication'' in the catalog vs ''Dynamics of Small Group Communication'' in the closed list.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Catalog prints ''Area 1: Administrative of Justice'' (sic).","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Riverside City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Riverside City College' and r.control_number = '41736' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
