":"Active"}],"kind":"Catalog and state file differ","owner":"college","text":"The catalog prints HIST-17 for this program, and the state''s Program Course File carries it there: the program points at HIST-17 CCC000628692, Active in COCI.","where":"Riverside City College''s program record in the state''s curriculum inventory"},{"kind":"Check not met","owner":"procedure","text":"The blocks add to 18-21 units; the catalog prints 18-19 units.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page prints two headings for the same ADT (Associate in Arts for Transfer and Associate Degree for Transfer, both AA1074); one requirements section follows.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Required Courses prints ''Units: 9.00'', which covers ETS-1, ETS-3 and the nested ''Select one of the following'' (SOC-15 or SOC-25); ETS-3 read as required (not part of the choice) because only that reading sums to 9 units.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Elective Courses: ''Select three courses from at least two areas'' (9-10 units). Areas: Area 1 History or Government (ETS-14/HIST-14, ETS-15/HIST-15, HIST-16, HIST-17); Area 2 Arts and Humanities (ARTH-9, ENGL-20, ETS-7, ETS-8, ETS-13/PHI-14); Area 3 Social Science (ETS-40, SOC-10/SOC-10H); Area 4 Quantitative Reasoning and Research Methods (STAT-C1000/STAT-C1000H, PSYC-48, SOC-48). The at-least-two-areas constraint is not expressible in the block rule.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"''Only one may be used'' pairs recorded as alternatives. In Area 4 it is unclear whether the ''Only one may be used'' group covers only STAT-C1000/STAT-C1000H or also PSYC-48 and SOC-48 (cross-listed, same title); PSYC-48 and SOC-48 recorded as separate entries—reviewer should check.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Catalog uses HIST- subject prefix while the closed list has HIS; HIST codes marked catalog_addition true. SOC-48 is not in the closed list.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"ETS-8 title in catalog is ''Introduction to Black Feminism and Womanism'' vs closed list ''Introduction to Black Feminism''.","where":"Riverside City College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on Riverside City College''s site (census run census-20261004T152832Z-s4of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'Riverside City College' and r.control_number = '43897' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
