e","Woodland Community College"],"credential":"AP Physics 1: Algebra-Based"},{"colleges":["Los Angeles Pierce College","Merced College"],"credential":"AP Physics C: Mechanics"},{"colleges":["Mt. San Jacinto College"],"credential":"AP Physics 1"},{"colleges":["Santa Ana College"],"credential":"AP Physics B"}],"credentials_n":4},"identity":{"id":"PHYS 105","kind":"C-ID","title":"Algebra/Trigonometry-Based Physics A"},"ids":[{"id":"PHYS 105","kind":"C-ID","title":"Algebra/Trigonometry-Based Physics A"}],"title":"General Physics"},"PSYC 258":{"adopt":{"colleges_n":1,"credentials":[{"colleges":["Los Angeles Pierce College"],"credential":"AP Statistics"}],"credentials_n":1},"identity":{"id":"SOCI 125","kind":"C-ID","title":"Introduction to Statistics in Sociology"},"ids":[{"id":"SOCI 125","kind":"C-ID","title":"Introduction to Statistics in Sociology"}],"title":"Behavioral Science Statistics"},"STAT C1000":{"identity":null,"title":"Introduction to Statistics"}},"figure":{"measure":"units","path":null,"path_picks":[],"path_why":"No pathway map has been read for this program.","picks":["EXSC 140A","EXSC 140B"],"total":{"max":24.5,"min":20},"up_to":2.0},"gaps":[{"kind":"Check not met","owner":"procedure","text":"The blocks add to 19-23.5 units; the catalog prints 20-24.5 units.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The page text begins mid-sentence (''siology for Transfer...''), so the award''s printed heading is cut off; section_heading uses the ''Requirements'' heading. The award is recorded as the A.A.-T in Kinesiology for Transfer.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Outcomes are printed once for ''the Kinesiology Program'' as a whole; this award shares that list, so it is recorded here.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No careers are named in the program text; the EXSC 241B course description mentions fields but course descriptions are not used for careers.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Movement block: the student selects at most one course from each of any three of six areas (Aquatics, Combative, Dance, Fitness, Individual Sports, Team Sports), minimum 3 units. The areas were combined into one choose-3 block. Area membership: Aquatics = EXSC 110A-116B; Combative = EXSC 147A-148D; Dance = DANC 112A-145B; Fitness = EXSC 125A-145D; Individual Sports = EXSC 154A, 154B, 154C, 154D, 160A-C, 166A-C, 168A-C, 178A-D, 179A-D, 180A-B; Team Sports = EXSC 156A-C, 158A-D, 164A-C, 174A-D, 176A-C, 182A-D, 183A-D, 184A-D. Each area heading prints ''Semester Units: 0.0''.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The requirements list prints 1.0 units beside the EXSC activity courses, while the state file stores 0.5 and the course descriptions show 0.5-1 units. Printed requirement-list values were used.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"DANC 126A/126B print 1.0 units in the catalog versus 0.5 in the state file. DANC 125A/B and 145A/B print 1.0-1.5.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Category A: BIOL 200 OR STAT C1000 OR PSYC 258 is one choice (printed group value 3.0). CHEM 200 AND CHEM 200L together form one choice (printed group value 5.0); they are recorded as two entries but count as a single selection.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"STAT C1000 is printed with a space; the closed list stores it as ''STATC1000''. It is treated as the same course, not a catalog addition.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"Award notes require certified completion of Cal-GETC and 60 CSU-transferable units; GE courses are not recorded in blocks.","where":"San Diego Mesa College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"census-20261011T162433Z-s2of4","host":null,"status":"none","text":"The weekly census found no published term-by-term program map on San Diego Mesa College''s site (census run census-20261011T162433Z-s2of4).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'San Diego Mesa College' and r.control_number = '31843' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
