iramar College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The Learning Outcome(s) text is cut off mid-sentence (''Students who complete the Aviation General Studies Program will be''), so no outcomes were recorded. A reviewer should check the source for the full outcome.","where":"San Diego Miramar College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"The career entry ''aviation industry'' is taken from ''Prepares the student for employment in the aviation industry.''","where":"San Diego Miramar College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"},{"kind":"Reader''s note","owner":"procedure","text":"No general education pattern is named; the Award Note only states that the Associate Degree requires 60 degree-applicable units.","where":"San Diego Miramar College''s CurriQunet META reading procedure"}],"map":{"checked_run":"program-sequence-ppm run 37197332656","host":"san-diego-miramar.programmapper.com","status":"refused","text":"Miramar''s Program Pathways Mapper, linked from sdmiramar.edu/program-mapper, answered all seven of the reader''s requests 403 Forbidden on 2026-10-04 (sequence run 37197332656), and the 17 other mapper hosts probed that day did the same: the refusal is the mapper service''s. The pilot''s sequence for Fire Technology A.S. (05100) is not yet read. The reader keeps its name and never retries a refusal another way. It looks for the sequence on the college''s own pages and in its catalog, and asks this host''s front page once a run whether it has opened (Sam, open-asks sheet 29 card 3, 2026-10-04).","url":null},"v":1}'::jsonb from public.program_requirement_records r where r.college = 'San Diego Miramar College' and r.control_number = '16731' on conflict (college, control_number) do update set display = excluded.display;
